# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and checked out as
# LF everywhere, whatever a given machine's core.autocrlf says. Without
# this, a rebuild on a Windows checkout rewrites generated files — the
# blocks plugin's build/ output above all — with CRLF, and every one of
# them then shows up as modified while being byte-identical once
# normalised. That noise buries the files a change actually touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff  binary
